            correct: "This approach — showing how characterization, symbolic imagery, and narrative structure work TOGETHER to develop a shared central theme — demonstrates sophisticated, INTEGRATED literary analysis, recognizing that a novel's various literary elements don't operate in isolation but often work COHESIVELY together to reinforce and develop the work's larger meaning, which represents a high level of analytical sophistication.",
            wrong: { 0: "This approach specifically maintains a CLEAR analytical FOCUS (the shared central theme) while drawing MEANINGFUL, well-integrated connections between multiple literary elements that all serve this same focus — this is NOT disorganized; it demonstrates a cohesive, unified analytical structure connecting multiple elements around one thematic through-line.", 2: "These elements (characterization, imagery, structure) are being connected specifically because they GENUINELY and MEANINGFULLY relate to and reinforce the SAME central theme — this is not an irrelevant or arbitrary inclusion, but a deliberate, well-reasoned synthesis.", 3: "Single-element analysis (focusing deeply on just one specific technique, like imagery alone) CAN also be a legitimate, valuable analytical approach, depending on the specific essay's scope and purpose — the INTEGRATED, multi-element approach described here is ONE sophisticated option, but not the ONLY valid approach to literary analysis." },
            tempting: "Choice D is tempting because integrated, multi-element analysis IS sophisticated, but it's not the ONLY legitimate approach — focused, single-element analysis (done thoroughly and well) can also be a valid, effective analytical strategy depending on an essay's specific scope and goals.",
